# Agent Router POC - Implementation Plan

## Project Overview

Build a proof of concept for an autonomous agent that:
- Receives user queries and routes to available tools/agents
- Uses any LLM provider (OpenAI, Gemini, LM Studio, Grok)
- Manages persona/role via YAML-based system prompts
- Connects to MCP tools, MCP agents, and A2A agents
- Makes autonomous routing decisions using LLM
- Stores every LLM call in MongoDB for audit trails
- Self-heals from failures using LLM analysis

**Key Design**: ONE main agent that does routing and orchestration (not multiple agents)

**Stack**:
- Language: Python
- Package Manager: Poetry
- Database: MongoDB (local community server)
- Environment: Local development with LM Studio support (no Docker dependency)

> **📖 Architecture Reference**: For detailed architecture diagrams, component responsibilities, design principles, and technology decisions, see [architecture.mdc](.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc).
