## Quick Component Summary

> **📖 Full Details**: See [architecture.mdc - Component Responsibilities](.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc#component-responsibilities) for complete descriptions and interaction diagrams.

**Core Components**:
1. **Main Script** - Dumb I/O glue (receives input, yields output)
2. **Agent Layer** - THE smart orchestrator (all intelligence lives here)
3. **LLM Service** - Multi-provider LLM access (OpenAI, Gemini, LM Studio, Grok)
4. **Orchestrator** - Dumb executor (runs tools, logs execution)
5. **Storage Layer** - MongoDB persistence (llm_calls, tool_executions, conversations)
6. **Connectors** - MCP and A2A protocol communication

**Key Principle**: Agent Layer makes ALL decisions. Everything else is dumb infrastructure.

